#pragma once
// World sync (lua/coop/world_*.lua, docs/world-sync-protocol.md): spliced in
// this order right after partner_sync_source (seven chunks). Each file is one do ... end
// block of at most 16000 bytes (CMakeLists.txt checks it: MSVC literal limit).
